# Checked-out text files are LF on every OS: the build locks and generated files (modules.json, sw.js's list, the CSP
# hash) hash file bytes, so a Windows checkout with CRLF would fail their --check.
# An existing CRLF checkout needs `git add --renormalize .` (or a fresh clone) once after taking this.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
